lists SouthernSanDoria/Amaura/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/955 WindurstWaters/Library_book3/onTrigger GraubergS/Fey_Blossoms/onTrigger GraubergS/Fey_Blossoms/onTrade SouthernSanDoriaS/Raustigne/onTrigger
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-82.867,-6.949,91.148 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg PillarOfHope current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
